  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/LostBeard/SpawnDev.Reachy",
  "published": "2026-09-16T14:12:43.123Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.1.0-preview.1 - first release. ReachyMiniJs (typed SpawnJS wrapper over the browser SDK, pinned to @pollen-robotics/reachy-mini-sdk 1.8.0, loaded via JS.Import so no JavaScript ships here) and ReachyWebRtcTransport (IReachyMotion + IReachyLifecycle over it, plus robot-speaker audio out). Verified end to end on a real wireless Reachy Mini, daemon v1.10.0: Hugging Face sign-in, signalling, robot pick, WebRTC session, wake, and commanded head motion arriving on the robot. Wireless robots only - the central signalling server does not serve the Lite.",
